  "account": "赵健的读书日记",
  "source_title": "诸君，你觉得无人驾驶和有人驾驶，哪个更安全？你相信吗，机器人竟然能看懂镜子里的自己。今天我在哥伦比亚大学听了一堂Hod Lipson 教授的课，整堂课听下来，我最大的感受是：我们可能严重低估了AI接下来改变世界的速度。#超级AI #哥伦比亚大学 #纽约 #自动驾驶",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 315.584,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "朱军，你觉得无人驾驶和有人驾驶哪个更安全？你相信吗？机器人竟然能够看得懂镜子里的自己？今天我在美国哥伦比亚大学听了一堂hold普lison教授的课，他是人类三d打印技术的先驱。而近几年重点研究AI从屏幕里走出来的自我模型，建设他的团队，让机器人已经开始学会照镜子，来认识自己，把这种能力叫做一种自我建模。机器人尝试着去理解、思考，我是谁？朱军，我们已经前总是安慰自己机器人有知识，但他没有情感。但是这个教授的团队做过一个机器人，他会观察人的面部变化，能够提前大约八百四十毫秒预测你即将微笑，然后几乎和你同时笑出来。不是等你笑完他在模仿你，而是他提前预判，你要笑了，然后和你一起笑。你想想那个画面是不是挺恐怖的。他们在培养AI机器人的本能和直觉。而第二件事情会让很多老司机不服气，他觉得很多论证在一些现实场景里面，自动驾驶现在已经完全比人类开的更安全。二十年以后的人，看今天的人还在亲自开着车，就像我们今天看别人在骑马骑驴，起码最多只是个爱好，但它确实有危险啊，未来你自己开车也可能会变成类似的事情。不是因为人类突然不会开车，而是因为机器不允许你犯人的错误，人会困有路，怒症会走神等等。而第三件事情，所有家长都必须听你，孩子未来最喜欢的老师可能根本不是一个真的人。普lason教授课堂上直接放了一个数字，百分之八十三的学生更喜欢AI老师，因为AI更有耐心，他不会责怪你，也不会和你生气。人类老师最贵的东西是什么？不是知识，是时间。一个老师面对三十个孩子再负责任，也不可能每个人讲五十遍。但是AI可以你不会再讲一遍，还不会换一种方式，讲二十四小时永远在线。 Ai第一次让每一个普通家庭也拥有一种过去只有极少数人买得起的东西，无限时的一对一教育。你想想，当一个永远不累，永远不烦，越来越懂你，而且只服你一个人的老师出现以后，人类老师最不可替代的东西到底是什么？听到这里很多人会担心，那是不是以后老师就要失业了，司机就要失业了。但是教授反而提醒我们，真正的机会，恰恰可能比被替代的岗位要更多。这件事情其实每次技术革命都发生过，当年汽车出来以后，马车夫确实少了，但是后来出现了很多以前根本不存在的职业。汽车设计师、维修工、高速公路、保险、加油站、物流网约车等等。所以，真正值得我们担心的，不是未来还有没有工作，而是未来新增的工作里有没有你的位置。这两句话差别太大了。整堂课最让我觉得普通人兴奋的一件事情，AI不是只会抢饭碗，它会推动人类创造力真正转化为生产力的大爆发。时代教授在各大有个本科学生有一天突然跑过去问了一个问题，怎么判断两个指纹是不是同一个人呢？你能想象吗？这个学生根本没有学过任何法医科学，但是他和团队采集了六万多枚的指纹去训练AI,结果发现同一个人不同，手指留下的指纹，其实存在一种机器可以识别的相似性。这项成果还发表在了科学杂志。你想想，一个外行的学生，只要借助AI,竟然可以闯进一个成熟的行业。你干了二十多年，未来有可能输给一个刚入行二十天的人。下面这句话，我建议所有靠脑子吃饭的人都牢牢记住，你当下最值钱的本事，会不会恰好是AI最便宜的功能。你花了十几年去读书考试考证，又花十几年累积经验，终于成了别人嘴里的专业人士。结果有一天你突然发现，别人打开一个软件，三十秒钟就能完成你过去大半天的工作。那个时候真正残酷的问题是你除了AI也会东西还剩下什么？这节课听下来，我最大的感受是，我们可能严重低估了AI接下来改变世界的速度。我向教授问了一个对我自己特别重要的问题，因为我是做新媒体的，我就问他AI现在能够写文章，会做视频，会生成声音，也能够生成一个和真人一模一样的主播。那我们这些内容创作者到底靠什么去面对？下一个时代，他给我的答案特别短，就因此真实感真正的去做真正的去爱，真正的去表达，真正的去成为你自己。在AI时代，最大的稀缺品不是聪明，而是真实。不要把自己活成一个内容，生产机器，多去读书旅行，见人进入各种现场，真正强的内容，要说出人们早有的感受，却一直没有能精准说出的那句话。他说你要努力做到当某件事情发生的时候，观众会主动想到哎这个问题，我想听听赵建他会是怎么说的当机器越来越像人人最重要的事情，就是别把自己活成机器。因为在像机器这件事情上，人类注定赢不了机器，真正值得我们训练的是机器，难以替代我们完成的东西。去爱去冒险，去现场，去经历，去犯错、去创造，去成为你自己。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00001",
      "start_ms": 400,
      "end_ms": 800,
      "text": "朱军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1060,
      "end_ms": 4380,
      "text": "你觉得无人驾驶和有人驾驶哪个更安全？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4760,
      "end_ms": 5460,
      "text": "你相信吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00004",
      "start_ms": 5580,
      "end_ms": 8160,
      "text": "机器人竟然能够看得懂镜子里的自己？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00005",
      "start_ms": 8600,
      "end_ms": 11980,
      "text": "今天我在美国哥伦比亚大学听了一堂hold普lison教授的课，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00006",
      "start_ms": 12240,
      "end_ms": 14360,
      "text": "他是人类三d打印技术的先驱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00007",
      "start_ms": 14480,
      "end_ms": 17860,
      "text": "而近几年重点研究AI从屏幕里走出来的自我模型，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00008",
      "start_ms": 17860,
      "end_ms": 19320,
      "text": "建设他的团队，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00009",
      "start_ms": 19500,
      "end_ms": 22080,
      "text": "让机器人已经开始学会照镜子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00010",
      "start_ms": 22080,
      "end_ms": 22980,
      "text": "来认识自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00011",
      "start_ms": 23120,
      "end_ms": 25500,
      "text": "把这种能力叫做一种自我建模。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00012",
      "start_ms": 25840,
      "end_ms": 27540,
      "text": "机器人尝试着去理解、思考，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00013",
      "start_ms": 27540,
      "end_ms": 28320,
      "text": "我是谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00014",
      "start_ms": 28320,
      "end_ms": 29400,
      "text": "朱军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00015",
      "start_ms": 29400,
      "end_ms": 32450,
      "text": "我们已经前总是安慰自己机器人有知识，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00016",
      "start_ms": 32450,
      "end_ms": 33710,
      "text": "但他没有情感。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00017",
      "start_ms": 33710,
      "end_ms": 36090,
      "text": "但是这个教授的团队做过一个机器人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00018",
      "start_ms": 36090,
      "end_ms": 38170,
      "text": "他会观察人的面部变化，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00019",
      "start_ms": 38170,
      "end_ms": 41830,
      "text": "能够提前大约八百四十毫秒预测你即将微笑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00020",
      "start_ms": 41830,
      "end_ms": 43930,
      "text": "然后几乎和你同时笑出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00021",
      "start_ms": 44190,
      "end_ms": 46090,
      "text": "不是等你笑完他在模仿你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00022",
      "start_ms": 46150,
      "end_ms": 47450,
      "text": "而是他提前预判，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00023",
      "start_ms": 47670,
      "end_ms": 48470,
      "text": "你要笑了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00024",
      "start_ms": 48550,
      "end_ms": 49790,
      "text": "然后和你一起笑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00025",
      "start_ms": 50050,
      "end_ms": 52050,
      "text": "你想想那个画面是不是挺恐怖的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00026",
      "start_ms": 52210,
      "end_ms": 54810,
      "text": "他们在培养AI机器人的本能和直觉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00027",
      "start_ms": 55410,
      "end_ms": 58210,
      "text": "而第二件事情会让很多老司机不服气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00028",
      "start_ms": 58590,
      "end_ms": 61460,
      "text": "他觉得很多论证在一些现实场景里面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00029",
      "start_ms": 61460,
      "end_ms": 64645,
      "text": "自动驾驶现在已经完全比人类开的更安全。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00030",
      "start_ms": 65120,
      "end_ms": 66160,
      "text": "二十年以后的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00031",
      "start_ms": 66160,
      "end_ms": 68040,
      "text": "看今天的人还在亲自开着车，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00032",
      "start_ms": 68180,
      "end_ms": 70475,
      "text": "就像我们今天看别人在骑马骑驴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00033",
      "start_ms": 70980,
      "end_ms": 72460,
      "text": "起码最多只是个爱好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00034",
      "start_ms": 72500,
      "end_ms": 74080,
      "text": "但它确实有危险啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00035",
      "start_ms": 74080,
      "end_ms": 76845,
      "text": "未来你自己开车也可能会变成类似的事情。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00036",
      "start_ms": 77130,
      "end_ms": 78870,
      "text": "不是因为人类突然不会开车，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00037",
      "start_ms": 79010,
      "end_ms": 81585,
      "text": "而是因为机器不允许你犯人的错误，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00038",
      "start_ms": 81880,
      "end_ms": 83140,
      "text": "人会困有路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00039",
      "start_ms": 83140,
      "end_ms": 84775,
      "text": "怒症会走神等等。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00040",
      "start_ms": 85180,
      "end_ms": 86260,
      "text": "而第三件事情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00041",
      "start_ms": 86260,
      "end_ms": 88390,
      "text": "所有家长都必须听你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00042",
      "start_ms": 88390,
      "end_ms": 91875,
      "text": "孩子未来最喜欢的老师可能根本不是一个真的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00043",
      "start_ms": 92320,
      "end_ms": 94540,
      "text": "普lason教授课堂上直接放了一个数字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00044",
      "start_ms": 94700,
      "end_ms": 97705,
      "text": "百分之八十三的学生更喜欢AI老师，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00045",
      "start_ms": 98050,
      "end_ms": 99490,
      "text": "因为AI更有耐心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00046",
      "start_ms": 99670,
      "end_ms": 100650,
      "text": "他不会责怪你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00047",
      "start_ms": 100670,
      "end_ms": 101825,
      "text": "也不会和你生气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00048",
      "start_ms": 102290,
      "end_ms": 104165,
      "text": "人类老师最贵的东西是什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00049",
      "start_ms": 104410,
      "end_ms": 105150,
      "text": "不是知识，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00050",
      "start_ms": 105210,
      "end_ms": 106155,
      "text": "是时间。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00051",
      "start_ms": 106610,
      "end_ms": 109230,
      "text": "一个老师面对三十个孩子再负责任，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00052",
      "start_ms": 109230,
      "end_ms": 110830,
      "text": "也不可能每个人讲五十遍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00053",
      "start_ms": 111050,
      "end_ms": 114050,
      "text": "但是AI可以你不会再讲一遍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00054",
      "start_ms": 114230,
      "end_ms": 115670,
      "text": "还不会换一种方式，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00055",
      "start_ms": 115670,
      "end_ms": 118055,
      "text": "讲二十四小时永远在线。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00056",
      "start_ms": 118400,
      "end_ms": 123295,
      "text": " Ai第一次让每一个普通家庭也拥有一种过去只有极少数人买得起的东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00057",
      "start_ms": 123730,
      "end_ms": 125575,
      "text": "无限时的一对一教育。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00058",
      "start_ms": 125900,
      "end_ms": 126420,
      "text": "你想想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00059",
      "start_ms": 126640,
      "end_ms": 128020,
      "text": "当一个永远不累，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00060",
      "start_ms": 128160,
      "end_ms": 128960,
      "text": "永远不烦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00061",
      "start_ms": 129140,
      "end_ms": 130045,
      "text": "越来越懂你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00062",
      "start_ms": 130260,
      "end_ms": 132605,
      "text": "而且只服你一个人的老师出现以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00063",
      "start_ms": 132980,
      "end_ms": 135555,
      "text": "人类老师最不可替代的东西到底是什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00064",
      "start_ms": 135890,
      "end_ms": 137210,
      "text": "听到这里很多人会担心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00065",
      "start_ms": 137370,
      "end_ms": 139050,
      "text": "那是不是以后老师就要失业了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00066",
      "start_ms": 139150,
      "end_ms": 140285,
      "text": "司机就要失业了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00067",
      "start_ms": 140560,
      "end_ms": 142075,
      "text": "但是教授反而提醒我们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00068",
      "start_ms": 142360,
      "end_ms": 143300,
      "text": "真正的机会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00069",
      "start_ms": 143320,
      "end_ms": 145905,
      "text": "恰恰可能比被替代的岗位要更多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00070",
      "start_ms": 146290,
      "end_ms": 148785,
      "text": "这件事情其实每次技术革命都发生过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00071",
      "start_ms": 149090,
      "end_ms": 150390,
      "text": "当年汽车出来以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00072",
      "start_ms": 150450,
      "end_ms": 151795,
      "text": "马车夫确实少了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00073",
      "start_ms": 152080,
      "end_ms": 155245,
      "text": "但是后来出现了很多以前根本不存在的职业。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00074",
      "start_ms": 155590,
      "end_ms": 161385,
      "text": "汽车设计师、维修工、高速公路、保险、加油站、物流网约车等等。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00075",
      "start_ms": 161820,
      "end_ms": 162080,
      "text": "所以，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00076",
      "start_ms": 162080,
      "end_ms": 163200,
      "text": "真正值得我们担心的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00077",
      "start_ms": 163200,
      "end_ms": 164560,
      "text": "不是未来还有没有工作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00078",
      "start_ms": 164820,
      "end_ms": 167880,
      "text": "而是未来新增的工作里有没有你的位置。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00079",
      "start_ms": 167960,
      "end_ms": 169470,
      "text": "这两句话差别太大了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00080",
      "start_ms": 170000,
      "end_ms": 172855,
      "text": "整堂课最让我觉得普通人兴奋的一件事情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00081",
      "start_ms": 173130,
      "end_ms": 174830,
      "text": "AI不是只会抢饭碗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00082",
      "start_ms": 174930,
      "end_ms": 178750,
      "text": "它会推动人类创造力真正转化为生产力的大爆发。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00083",
      "start_ms": 178750,
      "end_ms": 183680,
      "text": "时代教授在各大有个本科学生有一天突然跑过去问了一个问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00084",
      "start_ms": 184100,
      "end_ms": 187040,
      "text": "怎么判断两个指纹是不是同一个人呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00085",
      "start_ms": 187300,
      "end_ms": 188100,
      "text": "你能想象吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00086",
      "start_ms": 188220,
      "end_ms": 190860,
      "text": "这个学生根本没有学过任何法医科学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00087",
      "start_ms": 191080,
      "end_ms": 194560,
      "text": "但是他和团队采集了六万多枚的指纹去训练AI,"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00088",
      "start_ms": 194780,
      "end_ms": 196540,
      "text": "结果发现同一个人不同，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00089",
      "start_ms": 196560,
      "end_ms": 197680,
      "text": "手指留下的指纹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00090",
      "start_ms": 197860,
      "end_ms": 200840,
      "text": "其实存在一种机器可以识别的相似性。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00091",
      "start_ms": 201080,
      "end_ms": 203360,
      "text": "这项成果还发表在了科学杂志。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00092",
      "start_ms": 203740,
      "end_ms": 204320,
      "text": "你想想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00093",
      "start_ms": 204580,
      "end_ms": 205940,
      "text": "一个外行的学生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00094",
      "start_ms": 206060,
      "end_ms": 207080,
      "text": "只要借助AI,"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00095",
      "start_ms": 207220,
      "end_ms": 209000,
      "text": "竟然可以闯进一个成熟的行业。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00096",
      "start_ms": 209000,
      "end_ms": 210630,
      "text": "你干了二十多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00097",
      "start_ms": 210810,
      "end_ms": 213630,
      "text": "未来有可能输给一个刚入行二十天的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00098",
      "start_ms": 213970,
      "end_ms": 214770,
      "text": "下面这句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00099",
      "start_ms": 214770,
      "end_ms": 217689,
      "text": "我建议所有靠脑子吃饭的人都牢牢记住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00100",
      "start_ms": 218190,
      "end_ms": 219970,
      "text": "你当下最值钱的本事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00101",
      "start_ms": 220190,
      "end_ms": 222730,
      "text": "会不会恰好是AI最便宜的功能。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00102",
      "start_ms": 223130,
      "end_ms": 225470,
      "text": "你花了十几年去读书考试考证，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00103",
      "start_ms": 225650,
      "end_ms": 227330,
      "text": "又花十几年累积经验，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00104",
      "start_ms": 227470,
      "end_ms": 229550,
      "text": "终于成了别人嘴里的专业人士。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00105",
      "start_ms": 229710,
      "end_ms": 231410,
      "text": "结果有一天你突然发现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00106",
      "start_ms": 231710,
      "end_ms": 233010,
      "text": "别人打开一个软件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00107",
      "start_ms": 233070,
      "end_ms": 235770,
      "text": "三十秒钟就能完成你过去大半天的工作。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00108",
      "start_ms": 236050,
      "end_ms": 241145,
      "text": "那个时候真正残酷的问题是你除了AI也会东西还剩下什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00109",
      "start_ms": 241410,
      "end_ms": 242230,
      "text": "这节课听下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00110",
      "start_ms": 242230,
      "end_ms": 243230,
      "text": "我最大的感受是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00111",
      "start_ms": 243410,
      "end_ms": 246725,
      "text": "我们可能严重低估了AI接下来改变世界的速度。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00112",
      "start_ms": 247240,
      "end_ms": 249725,
      "text": "我向教授问了一个对我自己特别重要的问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00113",
      "start_ms": 249930,
      "end_ms": 251195,
      "text": "因为我是做新媒体的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00114",
      "start_ms": 251380,
      "end_ms": 253890,
      "text": "我就问他AI现在能够写文章，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00115",
      "start_ms": 254030,
      "end_ms": 254770,
      "text": "会做视频，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00116",
      "start_ms": 254910,
      "end_ms": 255850,
      "text": "会生成声音，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00117",
      "start_ms": 255930,
      "end_ms": 258355,
      "text": "也能够生成一个和真人一模一样的主播。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00118",
      "start_ms": 258730,
      "end_ms": 261510,
      "text": "那我们这些内容创作者到底靠什么去面对？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00119",
      "start_ms": 261510,
      "end_ms": 262255,
      "text": "下一个时代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00120",
      "start_ms": 262850,
      "end_ms": 264090,
      "text": "他给我的答案特别短，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00121",
      "start_ms": 264170,
      "end_ms": 268160,
      "text": "就因此真实感真正的去做真正的去爱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00122",
      "start_ms": 268420,
      "end_ms": 269520,
      "text": "真正的去表达，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00123",
      "start_ms": 269680,
      "end_ms": 271295,
      "text": "真正的去成为你自己。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00124",
      "start_ms": 271730,
      "end_ms": 272550,
      "text": "在AI时代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00125",
      "start_ms": 272550,
      "end_ms": 274190,
      "text": "最大的稀缺品不是聪明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00126",
      "start_ms": 274370,
      "end_ms": 275485,
      "text": "而是真实。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00127",
      "start_ms": 275980,
      "end_ms": 277460,
      "text": "不要把自己活成一个内容，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00128",
      "start_ms": 277460,
      "end_ms": 278200,
      "text": "生产机器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00129",
      "start_ms": 278420,
      "end_ms": 280100,
      "text": "多去读书旅行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00130",
      "start_ms": 280340,
      "end_ms": 282020,
      "text": "见人进入各种现场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00131",
      "start_ms": 282220,
      "end_ms": 283440,
      "text": "真正强的内容，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00132",
      "start_ms": 283600,
      "end_ms": 285240,
      "text": "要说出人们早有的感受，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00133",
      "start_ms": 285440,
      "end_ms": 287620,
      "text": "却一直没有能精准说出的那句话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00134",
      "start_ms": 287780,
      "end_ms": 291080,
      "text": "他说你要努力做到当某件事情发生的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00135",
      "start_ms": 291080,
      "end_ms": 293500,
      "text": "观众会主动想到哎这个问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00136",
      "start_ms": 293640,
      "end_ms": 299160,
      "text": "我想听听赵建他会是怎么说的当机器越来越像人人最重要的事情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00137",
      "start_ms": 299160,
      "end_ms": 300855,
      "text": "就是别把自己活成机器。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00138",
      "start_ms": 301190,
      "end_ms": 303230,
      "text": "因为在像机器这件事情上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00139",
      "start_ms": 303250,
      "end_ms": 304855,
      "text": "人类注定赢不了机器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00140",
      "start_ms": 305250,
      "end_ms": 307170,
      "text": "真正值得我们训练的是机器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00141",
      "start_ms": 307310,
      "end_ms": 308950,
      "text": "难以替代我们完成的东西。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00142",
      "start_ms": 309090,
      "end_ms": 310490,
      "text": "去爱去冒险，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00143",
      "start_ms": 310630,
      "end_ms": 311270,
      "text": "去现场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00144",
      "start_ms": 311410,
      "end_ms": 312105,
      "text": "去经历，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00145",
      "start_ms": 312410,
      "end_ms": 313965,
      "text": "去犯错、去创造，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1534b93d7bdf060c_s00146",
      "start_ms": 314230,
      "end_ms": 315375,
      "text": "去成为你自己。"
    }
  ],
